<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 2.15 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 2.15 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited UK a round of fixed rate operations comprising repos to June 3 and 4 and outright offers of bills maturing or or before June 4 to help alleviate a revised forecast 2.15 billion stg liquidity shortage in the market.</p>
</text>
